 dialogue:{title:"La oferta de trabajo", scene:"Camila le pide consejo a su mentor Richard sobre si aceptar un puesto en una multinacional o quedarse en la startup que fundó con amigos.", a:"Richard", b:"Camila", lines:[
  ["A","You look like you've got a lot on your mind. What's going on?","Te ves con muchas cosas en la cabeza. ¿Qué pasa?"],
  ["B","I'm at a crossroads, Richard. A multinational has offered me a director's position.","Estoy en una encrucijada, Richard. Una multinacional me ofreció un cargo de directora."],
  ["A","Congratulations! But I take it you're not jumping for joy.","¡Felicitaciones! Pero supongo que no estás saltando de la alegría."],
  ["B","Not exactly. The salary is great, but it's a double-edged sword: I'd have far less freedom.","No exactamente. El salario es excelente, pero es un arma de doble filo: tendría mucha menos libertad."],
  ["A","And the startup? Last time we spoke, things were tense.","¿Y la startup? La última vez que hablamos, las cosas estaban tensas."],
  ["B","They still are. Our main investor keeps moving the goalposts. Every quarter there's a new target.","Siguen así. Nuestro principal inversionista cambia las reglas todo el tiempo. Cada trimestre hay una meta nueva."],
  ["A","That sounds exhausting. Is that the real reason you're considering leaving?","Suena agotador. ¿Esa es la verdadera razón por la que estás pensando en irte?"],
  ["B","Partly. And honestly, the late payments to staff are just the tip of the iceberg.","En parte. Y sinceramente, los pagos atrasados al personal son solo la punta del iceberg."],
  ["A","Have you raised it with your co-founders, or is it the elephant in the room?","¿Lo has hablado con tus socios, o es el tema que todos evitan?"],
  ["B","The elephant in the room, definitely. Nobody wants to open that can of worms.","El tema que todos evitan, definitivamente. Nadie quiere destapar ese problema."],
  ["A","Well, you can't sit on the fence for much longer. When do they need an answer?","Bueno, no puedes quedarte sin decidir mucho tiempo más. ¿Cuándo necesitan una respuesta?"],
  ["B","By Friday. And I know for a fact that my old boss pulled some strings to get me the interview, so I'd hate to let him down.","Para el viernes. Y sé con certeza que mi exjefe movió palancas para conseguirme la entrevista, así que no quisiera quedarle mal."],
  ["A","That shouldn't be the deciding factor. What matters is where you'll grow.","Eso no debería ser lo decisivo. Lo que importa es dónde vas a crecer."],
  ["B","You're right. Maybe I just need to bite the bullet and have that conversation with my partners first.","Tienes razón. Tal vez simplemente tengo que hacer de tripas corazón y hablar primero con mis socios."],
  ["A","I think so. Whatever happens, it might turn out to be a blessing in disguise.","Creo que sí. Pase lo que pase, puede que resulte ser una bendición disfrazada."],
  ["B","Let's hope so. Thanks, Richard. I feel much clearer already.","Ojalá. Gracias, Richard. Ya me siento mucho más clara."]
 ]},
